    'Funnel stages: list your pipeline stages with their counts (leads, MQL, SQL, opportunity, customer, or whatever you track) and optionally the spend. You get stage-to-stage and top-to-bottom conversion, cost per unit at each stage, the weakest stage flagged, and what a 10% improvement there would add at the bottom.',
