    'ROAS compares revenue with spend and ignores what the product cost to deliver, so a 3× ROAS is profitable at a 60% gross margin and a loss at 30%. The break-even figures convert gross margin into the maximum you can pay at each stage, which is the number a media buyer actually needs.',

